Hello Gemma,

I suspect that this issue relates to a bug in GGIR 2.6-0 on CRAN, which was an update the broke the def.noc.sleep = c(22,7) functionality. This has been fixed in the development version of GGIR on GitHub (see installation instructions here <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIR.html#21_Install_R_and_RStudio>). Alternatively you could wait for the next GGIR release, which is hopefully later this month.

With kind regards,

Vincent

